{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "usercfg",
 "version": "0.6a",
 "title": "USER CFG (Digitone mk1)",
 "description": "Adds the stock Digitone Keys User Mode control page (page 24) to the regular Digitone's TRIG rotation, plus a USER CFG page (TRIG 3/3) that maps the ABCDEFGH encoders to sound parameters. The mapping is saved with the project through core-dn1 project data and written into the live User Mode page record. Needs core-dn1 4.0 on OS 1.44; independent of the machines companion.",
 "category": "Utility",
 "author": "x2k",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
